      "revised_prompt": "Create a clean commercial studio product photo for a Korean Coupang detail-page source library asset, final canvas exactly 1024x1536 portrait. Subject: one exact white long loose-fit arm sleeve, front side facing camera, displayed vertically straight-on on a warm neutral studio surface. Show the entire single sleeve from upper-arm elastic band to hand cuff with generous breathing room above and below, centered and safely inside a center-crop-safe area. Preserve the canonical real product identity: relaxed tube silhouette, not compression-tight; fine irregular vertical pleats in thin matte woven fabric; elastic upper-arm band; wide back-of-hand cuff; visible thumb opening; one visible white woven label near the lower section with exact two-line black text reading HELLO over CUTE SLEEVE. Do not add a second sleeve. Do not invent rib knit, sports panels, mesh, zippers, drawstrings, silicone strips, anti-slip dots, extra seams, extra holes, extra labels, logos, icons, text overlays, badges, or watermarks. Lighting: controlled soft studio lighting, smooth gradients, crisp natural edges, subtle realistic shadow transitions, low-ISO clarity. Texture should preserve meaningful fine structure and material cues with coherent, non-random texture. No speckles, glitter-like noise, film grain, sensor noise, dithering, JPEG artifacts, crunchy sharpening, chaotic micro-contrast, or waxy blur. Warm neutral editorial background only.",
